From: Caskrun contributors
Subject: Original native text-editing integration for upstream Wine 11

SPDX-License-Identifier: LGPL-2.1-or-later

Native Edit commands forward balanced Windows shortcuts. A Steam-only text
context fallback targets with the original balanced right-button pair, then
asynchronously replaces only a verified same-root/thread Windows menu after
EndMenu has completed. Unknown custom popups retain their original menu.
No clipboard or field content is read. Old event/query ordinals stay fixed.

